  "body": "## Changelog\r\n\r\n### Added\r\n\r\n- Keymaps to scroll details pane from the list pane\r\n- Keymaps to scroll details pane to the top/bottom\r\n\r\n### Changed\r\n\r\n- Show raw decoded message when protobuf decoding fails\r\n- kplay's TUI won't be rendered if terminal dimensions are below the required minimum\r\n- Pressing Ctrl+C will immediately exit the TUI, regardless of the current context\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n* 3bb459e6f07b66c8a0ee283b313b2c3c1c08b7bb allow scrolling details pager from list pane (#112)\r\n* 0aa5201751035b29a80c48fcb2f161babffdf0bc fix: quit help pane when ? is pressed (#111)\r\n* 7147ae798c233fd47b7c46aa161195e426f7a156 reorder help pane items\r\n* 894433bac81d0fb61f972792438ea1872ff2ff39 reset details scroll when a msg is selected (#113)\r\n* d95cdbad4e708f32a977ce35e90d393c69f2e025 show raw decoded message when proto decode fails (#109)\r\n* 0a3928d8992b21ecf715e3fd73103a21ed4ceb94 update docs for v3.1.0 (#114)\r\n* 35e6898b53016acdb8d5fd1b1e0af40a00b3ef70 wrap contents in message value viewport (#110)\r\n\r\n"
}
